---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dual Wallet System — Xhavic"
  description="Two execution paths at the sequencer level. Instant Wallet for composable DeFi. Secured Wallet with 24-hour reversal for institutional operations."
>

  <!-- ============================================================
       HERO — Dark +
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-dark text-white pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-16 md:pb-22">
    <div class="container max-w-container-lg">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8" data-reveal>
        <a href="/protocol" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Protocol</a>
        <span class="text-gray-600">/</span>
        <span class="text-white font-medium">Dual Wallet System</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- Headline block -->
      <div class="max-w-4xl mb-14" data-reveal>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 gradient-text-static leading-[0.95]">
          Two Execution Paths.<br/>One Network.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          The Dual Wallet System separates transaction execution at the sequencer level,
          giving every user the choice between instant composability and 24-hour reversibility
          &mdash; within a single chain.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero preview cards -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 max-w-3xl" data-reveal-stagger>
        <!-- Instant card -->
        <div class="glass-card group" style="border-color: rgba(34, 98, 255, 0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-primary/30">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Instant Wallet</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-primary font-semibold">&lt;200ms soft finality</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Composable, irreversible, built for DeFi speed. Trades, swaps, and liquidations execute at the pace the market demands.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Secured card -->
        <div class="glass-card group" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.15); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" style="color: #c4a35a;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Secured Wallet</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #c4a35a;">24-hour escrow window</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Reversible, escrowed, designed for institutional safety. Treasury moves and high-value transfers get the protection they require.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTAs -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-10" data-reveal>
        <a href="/whitepaper" class="btn-primary">Read the Whitepaper</a>
        <a href="/docs" class="btn bg-white/10 text-white border border-white/15 px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-3.5 hover:bg-white/15 active:scale-[0.98]">
          Developer Integration
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       THE PROBLEM — White bg, editorial prose
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-white" data-reveal>
    <div class="container max-w-container-xs">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink mb-8 leading-tight">
        A financial system that treats every<br class="hidden md:block"/> transaction the same is broken.
      </h2>

      <!-- Pull quote -->
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 py-2 my-10">
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-ink leading-snug italic">
          "Every existing L2 treats every transaction identically &mdash; same execution pipeline, same finality model, same risk profile."
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-muted">
        <p>
          A $50 token swap and a $5 million treasury transfer go through the exact same process.
          They share the same confirmation time, the same reversibility constraints, and the same
          composability model. This forces users to choose between speed and safety &mdash; a false
          choice that no well-designed financial system would impose.
        </p>
        <p>
          These transactions have fundamentally different risk profiles, different stakeholders, and
          different requirements. The architecture should reflect that reality.
        </p>
        <p class="text-primary font-semibold not-italic">
          Xhavic solves this with protocol-level transaction risk routing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       HOW IT WORKS — Surface bg, split section with flow diagram
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-surface" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split-section items-start">
        <!-- Left: Explanation -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink mb-6">
            How It Works
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            The Dual Wallet System operates at the sequencer level. It is a protocol mechanism,
            not a user interface feature. When a transaction is submitted, the originating wallet
            type determines which execution path the sequencer uses.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Instant Wallets route transactions through the fast-finality pipeline &mdash; composable
            with all DeFi protocols, confirmed in under 200 milliseconds, and irreversible by design.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Secured Wallets route transactions through the escrow pipeline &mdash; held for 24 hours
            with multi-sig reversal capability, non-composable until finalized, and settled to Ethereum
            only after the escrow window closes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: CSS Flow Diagram -->
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-full max-w-md">
            <!-- Transaction origin -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-stroke px-6 py-3 text-center shadow-sm">
                <p class="text-xs text-muted uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-1">Origin</p>
                <p class="text-base font-bold text-ink">Transaction Submitted</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Connector line down -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
              <div class="w-px h-8 bg-stroke"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Sequencer box -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
              <div class="bg-dark rounded-lg px-8 py-3 text-center shadow-lg border border-white/10">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-1">Xhavic</p>
                <p class="text-base font-bold text-white">Sequencer</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Branch connector -->
            <div class="relative h-10 mb-6">
              <!-- Vertical stem -->
              <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 w-px h-4 bg-ink/20 -translate-x-px"></div>
              <!-- Horizontal bar -->
              <div class="absolute top-4 left-[20%] right-[20%] h-px bg-ink/20"></div>
              <!-- Left drop -->
              <div class="absolute left-[20%] top-4 w-px h-6 bg-primary/60"></div>
              <!-- Right drop -->
              <div class="absolute right-[20%] top-4 w-px h-6" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.6);"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Two paths -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <!-- Instant path -->
              <div class="rounded-lg border-2 border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 p-4 text-center">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Instant Path</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">&lt;200ms finality</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Composable</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Irreversible</p>
              </div>

              <!-- Secured path -->
              <div class="rounded-lg border-2 p-4 text-center" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3); background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.05);">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" style="color: #c4a35a;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">Secured Path</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">24h escrow</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Non-composable</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Reversible</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Settlement row -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mt-6">
              <div class="relative h-8 w-full">
                <div class="absolute left-[20%] top-0 w-px h-4 bg-primary/40"></div>
                <div class="absolute right-[20%] top-0 w-px h-4" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.4);"></div>
                <div class="absolute top-4 left-[20%] right-[20%] h-px bg-ink/15"></div>
                <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-4 w-px h-4 bg-ink/20 -translate-x-px"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-center">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-stroke px-6 py-3 text-center shadow-sm">
                <p class="text-xs text-muted uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-1">L1</p>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">Ethereum Settlement</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       INSTANT WALLET DEEP-DIVE — Dark bg, blue accent
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-dark text-white" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split-section">
        <!-- Left: Content -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-primary/30">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary tracking-tight">Instant Wallet</h2>
          </div>

          <p class="text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            The Instant Wallet is designed for speed-critical operations where composability
            is non-negotiable. Transactions achieve soft finality in under 200 milliseconds,
            making them immediately available for downstream contract execution.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">Full DeFi composability</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Other contracts can immediately build on transaction outputs.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">Irreversible by design</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Composability requires deterministic finality. No reversal mechanism exists.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">Ethereum settlement in ~13 minutes</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Standard L1 settlement after sequencer confirmation.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">Built for DeFi, liquidations, and AI agents</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Token swaps, perpetual futures, arbitrage, and automated strategies.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Spec card -->
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
          <div class="glass-card w-full max-w-sm" style="border-color: rgba(34, 98, 255, 0.2);">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary mb-6">Key Specifications</h3>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Soft Finality</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-lg">&lt;200ms</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Composable</span>
                <span class="text-primary font-bold">Yes</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Reversible</span>
                <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">No</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">L1 Settlement</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold">~13 min</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Security Model</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold">Speed-optimized</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       SECURED WALLET DEEP-DIVE — Dark-card bg, gold accent, reversed
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-dark text-white" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split-section reverse">
        <!-- Right (visually left due to reverse): Spec card -->
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
          <div class="glass-card w-full max-w-sm" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6" style="color: #c4a35a;">Key Specifications</h3>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Escrow Period</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-lg">24 hours</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Composable</span>
                <span class="font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">No (until final)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Reversible</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">Yes</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">L1 Settlement</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold">After escrow</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Reversal Method</span>
                <span class="text-white font-bold">Multi-sig</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Left (visually right due to reverse): Content -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.15); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7" style="color: #c4a35a;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight" style="color: #c4a35a;">Secured Wallet</h2>
          </div>

          <p class="text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            The Secured Wallet is designed for high-value operations where reversibility
            is critical. Transactions enter a 24-hour escrow period during which they can
            be reversed via multi-signature or threshold signature authorization.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">24-hour reversal window</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Authorized signers can reverse a transaction during the escrow period.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">Non-composable until finalized</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Transaction outputs cannot be used by other contracts during escrow.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">Multi-sig reversal mechanism</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Threshold signature scheme prevents unilateral reversal actions.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">Built for treasuries, RWA, and institutions</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Disbursements, settlements, and cross-chain movements at enterprise scale.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       COMPARISON TABLE — White bg, styled grid (not plain table)
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-white" data-reveal>
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Side-by-Side Comparison</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Each wallet type serves a distinct operational profile. Here is how they compare.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Table header -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-3">
        <div class="py-3 px-4">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Feature</p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-3 px-4 text-center rounded-t-lg bg-primary/5 border-t-2 border-primary">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Instant Wallet</p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-3 px-4 text-center rounded-t-lg border-t-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.05); border-color: #c4a35a;">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: #c4a35a;">Secured Wallet</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Rows -->
      <div class="space-y-2" data-reveal-stagger>
        <!-- Soft Finality -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Soft Finality</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary">&lt;200ms</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.05); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">24-hour escrow</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Composability -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Composability</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary">Full &mdash; DeFi composable</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.05); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">None until finalized</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Reversibility -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Reversibility</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-red-500">Irreversible</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.05); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600">Reversible during window</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Settlement -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">L1 Settlement</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">~13 minutes</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.05); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">After 24h escrow</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Best For -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Best For</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">Trades, swaps, liquidations</p>
          </div>
